## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
## EXCEPTION - deliberate scanner trap. See README, "The bin/ trap fixture".
##
## This build artifact is committed ON PURPOSE so a scan can prove TigerGate
## ignores build output and does not turn project self-references into packages.
##
## These negations MUST stay at the end of the file: git applies the last
## matching pattern, so `[Dd]ebug/` above would otherwise re-exclude the parent
## directory. Each parent directory is re-included before the file itself,
## because git will not descend into an excluded directory.
## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!src/TigerGateDemo.Api/bin/
!src/TigerGateDemo.Api/bin/Debug/
!src/TigerGateDemo.Api/bin/Debug/net8.0/
src/TigerGateDemo.Api/bin/Debug/net8.0/*
!src/TigerGateDemo.Api/bin/Debug/net8.0/TigerGateDemo.Api.deps.json
